B.aza=new A.c(B.o,["John 3:16",'"For God so loved the world that he gave his one and only Son, that whoever believes in him shall not perish but have eternal life."',"God's love is not passive \u2014 it moved Him to the greatest act of sacrifice in history. This verse is the entire gospel in one sentence: our problem (perishing), God's solution (His Son), and our response (belief).","According to John 3:16, what must a person do to have eternal life?",B.aqW,"Believe in God's Son"],t.R)
