B.a4q=A.a(s(["Strength","Understanding","Feelings","Plans"]),t.s)
B.av0=new A.c(B.o,["Proverbs 3:5-6",'"Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight."',"Human wisdom has real limits. We see a small slice of reality while God sees the whole picture. Trusting Him fully \u2014 even when things don't make sense \u2014 is not weakness; it's the wisest thing we can do.","Proverbs 3:5 says we should not lean on our own what?",B.a4q,"Understanding"],t.R)
