B.awt=new A.c(B.o,["Philippians 4:13",'"I can do all this through him who gives me strength."','Paul wrote this from prison \u2014 not from a place of comfort and success. His "all things" included suffering, hunger, and chains. The strength he speaks of is not for extraordinary feats, but for contentment and faithfulness in every circumstance.',"According to Philippians 4:13, where does Paul's strength come from?",B.a76,"Christ"],t.R)
