B.auT=new A.c(B.o,["Jeremiah 29:11",'"For I know the plans I have for you," declares the Lord, "plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future."',"These words were spoken to exiles in Babylon \u2014 people in one of the darkest chapters of Israel's history. God's promise of hope and a future isn't reserved for easy times. It's spoken most powerfully into hard ones.","Jeremiah 29:11 says God's plans for us include hope and what else?",B.a8x,"A future"],t.R)
