B.azU=new A.c(B.o,["Romans 12:2",'"Do not conform to the pattern of this world, but be transformed by the renewing of your mind. Then you will be able to test and approve what God\'s will is \u2014 his good, pleasing and perfect will."',"Transformation begins in the mind. The world constantly patterns our thinking through media, culture, and habit. Scripture calls us to a counter-cultural renovation of how we think \u2014 which changes how we live.","Romans 12:2 says we are transformed by the renewing of our what?",B.abC,"Mind"],t.R)
