B.azI=new A.c(B.o,["1 Corinthians 13:4",'"Love is patient, love is kind. It does not envy, it does not boast, it is not proud."',"Paul describes love not as a feeling but as a series of actions and choices. Love is patient \u2014 a verb. Love is kind \u2014 a verb. These qualities can be practiced even when feelings are absent. That is what makes agape love so radical.","According to 1 Corinthians 13:4, which of these is a characteristic of love?",B.a8X,"Patient"],t.R)
