B.avs=new A.c(B.o,["Ephesians 2:8-9",'"For it is by grace you have been saved, through faith \u2014 and this is not from yourselves, it is the gift of God \u2014 not by works, so that no one can boast."',"Salvation is entirely God's doing. We are not rescued because we earned it or deserved it \u2014 we are rescued because God gave it. This removes all pride and fills us instead with gratitude.","According to Ephesians 2:8-9, salvation is a gift \u2014 not a result of our what?",B.asr,"Works"],t.R)
