B.azW=new A.c(B.o,["James 1:2-3",'"Consider it pure joy, my brothers and sisters, whenever you face trials of many kinds, because you know that the testing of your faith produces perseverance."',"James does not say trials are joyful in themselves \u2014 he says we can consider them joy because of what they produce. Perseverance is a muscle; it only grows under resistance.","According to James 1:3, what does the testing of our faith produce?",B.aiv,"Perseverance"],t.R)
