B.awI=new A.c(B.o,["Hebrews 11:1",'"Now faith is confidence in what we hope for and assurance about what we do not see."',"Faith is not blind optimism \u2014 it is confidence grounded in the character of God. We believe what we cannot see because we know who promised it. The whole of Hebrews 11 is a gallery of people who staked their lives on this.","Hebrews 11:1 says faith is confidence in what we hope for and assurance about what we do not what?",B.ahv,"See"],t.R)
