B.azs=new A.c(B.o,["Galatians 5:22-23",'"But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, forbearance, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness and self-control."','Notice it\'s called "fruit" \u2014 singular \u2014 not "fruits." This is one unified character being formed in us, not a checklist we can partially complete. The Spirit produces all of these together as we remain connected to Christ, the vine.',"Which of these is listed as a fruit of the Spirit in Galatians 5?",B.a9w,"Joy"],t.R)
