B.azp=new A.c(B.o,["Psalm 46:10","\"He says, 'Be still, and know that I am God; I will be exalted among the nations, I will be exalted in the earth.'\"","The command to \"be still\" was given in the context of nations raging and kingdoms falling (Psalm 46:6). God's invitation to stillness is not an escape from the chaos \u2014 it's a reorientation toward the One who rules over all of it.",'Psalm 46:10 commands us to "be still" and know that who is God?',B.aqm,"I am"],t.R)
