B.auo=new A.c(B.o,["Matthew 11:28",'"Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest."',"Jesus is speaking to people crushed under the weight of religious laws and impossible standards. His invitation is not to try harder \u2014 it is to come. Rest in Scripture is not inactivity; it's the peace of being carried.","In Matthew 11:28, Jesus invites the weary to come to Him and receive what?",B.agG,"Rest"],t.R)
