B.auW=new A.c(B.o,["Isaiah 53:5",'"But he was pierced for our transgressions, he was crushed for our iniquities; the punishment that brought us peace was on him, and by his wounds we are healed."',"Written 700 years before the crucifixion, Isaiah's portrait of the Suffering Servant is one of the most remarkable prophecies in all of Scripture. Every phrase was fulfilled at Calvary.","Isaiah 53:5 says that by the wounds of the Suffering Servant we are what?",B.aaV,"Healed"],t.R)
B.a80=A.a(s(["Daily sacrifice","To love mercy","To fast weekly","To give tithes"]),t.s)
B.aws=new A.c(B.o,["Micah 6:8",'"He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the Lord require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God."',"Three requirements \u2014 justice toward others, mercy in our hearts, and humility before God. These are not three separate things to do; they are three dimensions of a single life aligned with God's character.","According to Micah 6:8, which of these is something the Lord requires of us?",B.a80,"To love mercy"],t.R)
