B.ay1=new A.c(B.o,["John 14:6","\"Jesus answered, 'I am the way and the truth and the life. No one comes to the Father except through me.'\"","Jesus does not say He knows the way, or teaches the truth, or gives life. He says He IS the way, the truth, and the life. This is a claim unlike anything any other religious teacher has ever made.","In John 14:6, Jesus says He is the way, the truth, and the what?",B.adp,"Life"],t.R)
B.aiu=A.a(s(["Wisdom","Healing","Power","Gifts"]),t.s)
B.avE=new A.c(B.o,["Acts 1:8",'"But you will receive power when the Holy Spirit comes on you; and you will be my witnesses in Jerusalem, and in all Judea and Samaria, and to the ends of the earth."',"Jesus' last recorded words before ascending are a commission and a promise. The commission is to be witnesses \u2014 everywhere. The promise is that we won't do it alone. The Spirit gives us what we need to fulfill what He calls us to.","According to Acts 1:8, what will the disciples receive when the Holy Spirit comes on them?",B.aiu,"Power"],t.R)
