B.avd=new A.c(B.o,["Revelation 21:4",'"He will wipe every tear from their eyes. There will be no more death or mourning or crying or pain, for the old order of things has passed away."',"The Bible begins in a garden and ends in a city. It begins with loss and ends with full restoration. Every tear, every goodbye, every unanswered prayer \u2014 all of it met with the personal tenderness of God wiping our eyes.","Revelation 21:4 says there will be no more death, mourning, crying, or what?",B.a9M,"Pain"],t.R)
