B.aym=new A.c(B.o,["Galatians 2:20",'"I have been crucified with Christ. It is no longer I who live, but Christ who lives in me. And the life I now live in the flesh I live by faith in the Son of God, who loved me and gave Himself for me."',"Paul describes the radical transformation of a life surrendered to Christ. Our old self dies and Christ takes the lead, empowering us to live by faith.","Who does Paul say now lives in him?",B.a4u,"Christ"],t.R)
B.a8L=A.a(s(["For service","For freedom","For worship","For suffering"]),t.s)
B.ayU=new A.c(B.o,["Galatians 5:1",'"For freedom Christ has set us free; stand firm therefore, and do not submit again to a yoke of slavery."',"Christ purchased our freedom at a great cost. We must guard this liberty and not return to the bondage of legalism or sin that once held us captive.","What has Christ set us free for?",B.a8L,"For freedom"],t.R)
