B.a9Z=A.a(s(["Exactly what we ask","A little more","Far more abundantly","Only what we deserve"]),t.s)
B.ayK=new A.c(B.o,["Ephesians 3:20",'"Now to Him who is able to do far more abundantly than all that we ask or think, according to the power at work within us."',"God's ability exceeds our greatest imagination. He is not limited by our requests but works far beyond what we could ever dream or conceive.","How much can God do compared to what we ask or think?",B.a9Z,"Far more abundantly"],t.R)
B.aqB=A.a(s(["As they deserve","As God in Christ forgave you","When they apologize","Only once"]),t.s)
B.avU=new A.c(B.o,["Ephesians 4:32",'"Be kind to one another, tenderhearted, forgiving one another, as God in Christ forgave you."',"Our forgiveness of others should mirror God's forgiveness of us. Kindness and tenderheartedness create communities that reflect the heart of Christ.","What is the standard for how we should forgive others?",B.aqB,"As God in Christ forgave you"],t.R)
