B.axY=new A.c(B.o,["Ephesians 6:10",'"Finally, be strong in the Lord and in the strength of His might."',"Our strength for spiritual battle comes not from ourselves but from the Lord. We must rely on His mighty power to stand firm against every challenge.","Where does our strength come from according to this verse?",B.ai8,"From the Lord and His might"],t.R)
