B.ase=A.a(s(["On earthly success","On things that are above","On future plans","On worldly wisdom"]),t.s)
B.avp=new A.c(B.o,["Colossians 3:2",'"Set your minds on things that are above, not on things that are on earth."',"Where we focus our thoughts shapes our entire lives. Paul urges us to fix our minds on heavenly realities rather than being consumed by earthly concerns.","Where should we set our minds?",B.ase,"On things that are above"],t.R)
