B.azO=new A.c(B.o,["Colossians 3:13",'"Bearing with one another and, if one has a complaint against another, forgiving each other; as the Lord has forgiven you, so you also must forgive."',"Forgiveness is not optional for believers. Since the Lord has freely forgiven us, we are called to extend that same grace to those who wrong us.","What is the basis for forgiving others?",B.aqp,"As the Lord has forgiven you"],t.R)
