B.aFx=new A.c(B.l,["How did God create Eve?",B.ada,"From Adam's rib","God caused Adam to fall into a deep sleep, took one of his ribs, and from it fashioned a woman and brought her to Adam.","Genesis 2:21-22"],t.M)
