B.aCd=new A.c(B.l,["Which king of Babylon besieged Jerusalem and took the captives?",B.a8v,"Nebuchadnezzar","Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon came to Jerusalem and besieged it, and the Lord delivered Jehoiakim into his hand.","Daniel 1:1-2"],t.M)
