B.aBJ=new A.c(B.l,["What did Daniel do before going to the king with the interpretation?",B.a7m,"He praised the God of heaven","After the mystery was revealed to Daniel in a night vision, he praised the God of heaven, acknowledging that wisdom and power belong to God.","Daniel 2:19-23"],t.M)
