B.aDJ=new A.c(B.l,["How much hotter did the king order the furnace to be heated?",B.a9b,"Seven times hotter than usual","Nebuchadnezzar was so furious that he ordered the furnace heated seven times hotter than usual.","Daniel 3:19"],t.M)
