B.aEN=new A.c(B.l,["What happened to the soldiers who threw the three men into the furnace?",B.aeV,"They were killed by the flames","The furnace was so hot that the flames of the fire killed the soldiers who threw Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego into it.","Daniel 3:22"],t.M)
