B.a72=A.a(s([u.hD,"Their robes were burned but they were unharmed","They had minor burns on their hands","They were unconscious but alive"]),t.s)
B.aFp=new A.c(B.l,["What was the condition of the three men when they came out of the furnace?",B.a72,u.hD,"The fire had not harmed their bodies, nor was a hair of their heads singed; their robes were not scorched, and there was no smell of fire on them.","Daniel 3:27"],t.M)
B.a4y=A.a(s([u.R,"All idols in Babylon must be destroyed","Everyone must worship Daniel's God","The furnace must be torn down"]),t.s)
B.aAX=new A.c(B.l,["What did Nebuchadnezzar decree after witnessing the miracle?",B.a4y,u.R,"The king decreed that anyone who said anything against the God of Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego would be cut into pieces, because no other god can save in this way.","Daniel 3:29"],t.M)
