B.aFo=new A.c(B.l,["What did Jesus use to heal the man who was born blind in the Gospel of John?",B.anj,"Mud made with saliva","Jesus spat on the ground, made mud with the saliva, and applied it to the blind man's eyes. He then told the man to wash in the Pool of Siloam, and he received his sight.","John 9:6-7"],t.M)
