B.aGy=new A.c(B.l,["How much was Judas paid to betray Jesus?",B.a9U,"Thirty pieces of silver","Judas Iscariot went to the chief priests and agreed to betray Jesus for thirty pieces of silver, fulfilling the prophecy in Zechariah 11:12.","Matthew 26:14-15"],t.M)
