B.a6O=A.a(s(["The altar crumbled",u.nK,"The temple collapsed","Fire came down from heaven"]),t.s)
B.aDz=new A.c(B.l,["What happened in the temple when Jesus died on the cross?",B.a6O,u.nK,"At the moment of Jesus' death, the curtain of the temple was torn in two from top to bottom, symbolizing that access to God was now open to all people through Christ.","Matthew 27:51"],t.M)
B.aj6=A.a(s(["Nicodemus","Joseph of Arimathea","Simon Peter","Lazarus"]),t.s)
B.aAP=new A.c(B.l,["Who provided the tomb where Jesus was buried?",B.aj6,"Joseph of Arimathea","Joseph of Arimathea, a wealthy and respected member of the council who was a secret disciple of Jesus, asked Pilate for the body and placed it in his own new tomb.","Matthew 27:57-60"],t.M)
B.a65=A.a(s(["Peter","John","Mary Magdalene","Mary the mother of Jesus"]),t.s)
B.aH8=new A.c(B.l,["Who was the first person to see the risen Jesus?",B.a65,"Mary Magdalene","Mary Magdalene went to the tomb early on Sunday morning. After finding it empty, the risen Jesus appeared to her first, and she went to tell the disciples.","John 20:11-18; Mark 16:9"],t.M)
B.afm=A.a(s(["Peter","Thomas","Andrew","Philip"]),t.s)
B.aBd=new A.c(B.l,["Which disciple doubted the resurrection until he saw Jesus' wounds?",B.afm,"Thomas",'Thomas was not present when Jesus first appeared to the disciples. He declared he would not believe until he saw and touched the nail marks. When Jesus appeared again, Thomas believed and exclaimed, "My Lord and my God!"',"John 20:24-28"],t.M)
B.aGB=new A.c(B.l,["How many days after His death did Jesus rise from the dead?",B.yq,"Three days","Jesus rose from the dead on the third day, just as He had predicted. He was crucified on Friday and rose early on Sunday morning.","Matthew 28:1-6; Luke 24:7"],t.M)
B.adP=A.a(s(["This was a righteous man","Surely this man was the Son of God","We have made a terrible mistake","His God has abandoned Him"]),t.s)
B.aB7=new A.c(B.l,["What did the Roman centurion say after witnessing Jesus' death?",B.adP,"Surely this man was the Son of God",'When the centurion who stood at the cross witnessed how Jesus died and the signs that accompanied His death, he declared, "Surely this man was the Son of God!"',"Mark 15:39"],t.M)
B.aq2=A.a(s(["The body of Jesus wrapped in cloth","Roman soldiers guarding the body","An angel sitting where Jesus had lain","Nothing at all"]),t.s)
B.aB0=new A.c(B.l,["What was found inside the tomb when the women arrived on Sunday morning?",B.aq2,"An angel sitting where Jesus had lain","When the women entered the tomb, they saw an angel in white who told them not to be afraid \u2014 Jesus had risen, just as He said He would.","Matthew 28:2-6"],t.M)
B.ar8=A.a(s(["When He called them by name","When He broke bread","When He showed them His wounds","When He quoted Scripture"]),t.s)
B.aET=new A.c(B.l,["On the road to Emmaus, two disciples walked with the risen Jesus without recognizing Him. When did they finally recognize Him?",B.ar8,"When He broke bread","The two disciples did not recognize Jesus as they walked together. But when He sat at the table with them, took bread, blessed and broke it, their eyes were opened and they recognized Him.","Luke 24:30-31"],t.M)
